CODE REVIEW TASK

Workspace: {{workspace}}
Diff command: {{diff_command}}
Review focus: {{review_focus}}
Severity floor: {{severity_floor}}
Pipeline step: {{pipeline_step}}
Previous results: {{previous_results}}

Run the diff command read-only from the workspace, inspect changed files, and produce a high-signal review. Do not modify files. Treat spec/, intent/, formal/ as authoritative when touched.

RESULT shape (write to the RESULT file at the workspace root):
{
  "signal": "pass|fix|fail",
  "summary": "one concise sentence",
  "verdict": "PASS|FIX|FAIL",
  "findings": [
    { "severity": "BLOCKER|CRITICAL|MAJOR|MINOR", "path": "file", "line": 1,
      "problem": "...", "why_it_matters": "...", "suggested_fix": "..." }
  ],
  "stats": { "files": 0, "insertions": 0, "deletions": 0 },
  "evidence": []
}

FAIL = any BLOCKER/CRITICAL. FIX = MAJOR-only. PASS = no blocker/major. No findings => empty array.
